# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "6. Determine stabilizers to measure {#6-determine-stabilizers-to-measure}"
msgstr "6. Tentukan penstabil untuk diukur {#6-determine-stabilizers-to-measure}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To test the performance of the error detection we will estimate the fidelity of the stabilizer state, $|\\psi\\rangle = U|0\\rangle^{\\otimes n}$, that the circuit ideally prepares against the noisy state, $\\rho$, the hardware actually outputs. The projector onto the pure stabilizer state, $|\\psi\\rangle$, is defined to be the uniform average over the $2^n$ elements of its stabilizer group $\\mathcal{S}$:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menguji prestasi pengesanan ralat, kita akan menganggar fidelity keadaan penstabil, $|\\psi\\rangle = U|0\\rangle^{\\otimes n}$, yang disediakan secara ideal oleh litar berbanding keadaan berhingar, $\\rho$, yang sebenarnya dikeluarkan oleh perkakasan. Unjuran ke atas keadaan penstabil tulen, $|\\psi\\rangle$, ditakrifkan sebagai purata seragam ke atas $2^n$ unsur kumpulan penstabilnya $\\mathcal{S}$:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$|\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi| = \\frac{1}{2^n}\\sum_{G \\in \\mathcal{S}} G$$\n"
msgstr "$$|\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi| = \\frac{1}{2^n}\\sum_{G \\in \\mathcal{S}} G$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plugging this into the fidelity equation, we see that the fidelity of noisy state, $\\rho$, is equivalent to the average expectation value of all stabilizers, $G \\in \\mathcal{S}$, with respect to $\\rho$:\n"
msgstr "Dengan memasukkan ini ke dalam persamaan fidelity, kita melihat bahawa fidelity keadaan berhingar, $\\rho$, setara dengan purata nilai jangkaan semua penstabil, $G \\in \\mathcal{S}$, terhadap $\\rho$:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$F = \\mathrm{Tr}(\\rho|\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi|) = \\mathrm{Tr}({\\frac{1}{2^n}\\sum_{G \\in \\mathcal{S}} \\rho G}) = \\frac{1}{2^n} \\sum_{G \\in \\mathcal{S}} \\mathrm{Tr}(\\rho G) = \\frac{1}{2^n} \\sum_{G \\in \\mathcal{S}} \\langle G \\rangle_\\rho$$\n"
msgstr "$$F = \\mathrm{Tr}(\\rho|\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi|) = \\mathrm{Tr}({\\frac{1}{2^n}\\sum_{G \\in \\mathcal{S}} \\rho G}) = \\frac{1}{2^n} \\sum_{G \\in \\mathcal{S}} \\mathrm{Tr}(\\rho G) = \\frac{1}{2^n} \\sum_{G \\in \\mathcal{S}} \\langle G \\rangle_\\rho$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For larger problems, measuring (or even enumerating) all $2^n$ stabilizers is infeasible, so fidelity is often estimated by measuring a random sample of stabilizers. Sampling $M$ stabilizers $G_1, \\ldots, G_M$ uniformly at random from $\\mathcal{S}$ gives an unbiased estimator of the fidelity, $\\hat F_M$,\n"
msgstr "Bagi masalah yang lebih besar, mengukur (atau malah menyenaraikan) kesemua $2^n$ penstabil tidak boleh dilaksanakan, jadi fidelity sering dianggarkan dengan mengukur sampel rawak penstabil. Mensampel $M$ penstabil $G_1, \\ldots, G_M$ secara seragam rawak daripada $\\mathcal{S}$ memberikan penganggar fidelity yang tidak berat sebelah, $\\hat F_M$,\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\\hat F_M = \\frac{1}{M} \\sum_{i=1}^M \\langle G_i \\rangle_\\rho$$\n"
"For this experiment we will make the circuit much deeper to enhance the effect of gate noise, and we will add checks to every qubit with a neighboring ancilla qubit. While there are more sophisticated ways to sample stabilizers to estimate fidelity, in this example we will sample $100$ stabilizers with uniform probability.\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\\hat F_M = \\frac{1}{M} \\sum_{i=1}^M \\langle G_i \\rangle_\\rho$$\n"
"Untuk eksperimen ini kita akan menjadikan litar jauh lebih dalam untuk meningkatkan kesan hingar gate, dan kita akan menambah semakan pada setiap qubit yang mempunyai qubit ancilla jiran. Walaupun terdapat cara yang lebih canggih untuk mensampel penstabil bagi menganggar fidelity, dalam contoh ini kita akan mensampel $100$ penstabil dengan kebarangkalian seragam.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "7. Find good checks for the whole state {#7-find-good-checks-for-the-whole-state}"
msgstr "7. Cari semakan yang baik untuk keseluruhan keadaan {#7-find-good-checks-for-the-whole-state}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We find one set of checks for the deep circuit exactly as in step 5. Since the checks read only their ancillas, the same checked circuit serves every sampled stabilizer. The returned circuits measure only the check ancillas, so we will add the payload measurements in the next step.\n"
msgstr "Kita mencari satu set semakan untuk litar dalam tersebut tepat seperti dalam langkah 5. Memandangkan semakan hanya membaca ancilla mereka, litar yang disemak yang sama digunakan untuk setiap penstabil yang disampel. Litar yang dipulangkan hanya mengukur ancilla semakan, jadi kita akan menambah pengukuran muatan dalam langkah seterusnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "8. Sample from the noisy circuit {#8-sample-from-the-noisy-circuit}"
msgstr "8. Sampel daripada litar yang berhingar {#8-sample-from-the-noisy-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We sample every variant, from the bare payload to the circuit with all ``7`` checks, for each sampled stabilizer. The variant with zero checks is the bare payload with the same measurements, so it serves as the noisy reference. Instead of appending the basis rotation of every stabilizer to a copy of every variant, we let [samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic) choose the measurement basis at sampling time. For each variant we:\n"
msgstr "Kita mensampel setiap varian, daripada muatan kosong hingga litar dengan kesemua ``7`` semakan, bagi setiap penstabil yang disampel. Varian tanpa semakan ialah muatan kosong dengan pengukuran yang sama, jadi ia berfungsi sebagai rujukan berhingar. Daripada menambah putaran asas bagi setiap penstabil pada salinan setiap varian, kita membiarkan [samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic) memilih asas pengukuran pada masa pensampelan. Bagi setiap varian kita:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Measure the payload and group the terminal measurements into a box with samplomatic's boxing pass manager. The box carries a ``ChangeBasis`` annotation, so ``build`` returns a template circuit whose basis-changing gates are parameterized, along with a samplex that computes the parameters for a requested basis.\n"
msgstr "Ukur muatan dan kumpulkan pengukuran terminal ke dalam satu kotak dengan pass manager boxing samplomatic. Kotak itu membawa anotasi ``ChangeBasis``, jadi ``build`` memulangkan litar templat yang gate pengubah asasnya berparameter, bersama samplex yang mengira parameter bagi asas yang diminta.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add the template and samplex to a ``QuantumProgram``. The samplex takes one measurement basis per qubit in the box, in ascending physical order, encoded as $I=0$, $Z=1$, $X=2$, $Y=3$. Passing an array of bases with a leading axis of length ``100`` makes a single item measure all ``100`` stabilizers: the payload in each stabilizer's basis and the ancillas in $Z$. A qubit outside a stabilizer's support is also measured in $Z$, and its bit is ignored when the stabilizer's expectation value is computed.\n"
msgstr "Tambah templat dan samplex ke ``QuantumProgram``. Samplex mengambil satu asas pengukuran bagi setiap qubit dalam kotak, dalam urutan fizikal menaik, dikodkan sebagai $I=0$, $Z=1$, $X=2$, $Y=3$. Menghantar tatasusunan asas dengan paksi utama berpanjang ``100`` menjadikan satu item mengukur kesemua ``100`` penstabil: muatan dalam asas setiap penstabil dan ancilla dalam $Z$. Qubit di luar sokongan sesuatu penstabil turut diukur dalam $Z$, dan bitnya diabaikan apabila nilai jangkaan penstabil dikira.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ``Executor`` primitive from ``qiskit-ibm-runtime`` runs the whole program in one job. Given an ``AerSimulator`` in place of a QPU it runs locally on that simulator, so we hand it one with the same depolarizing gate noise we used to find the checks, and use the stabilizer method since all of the circuits are Clifford. Qiskit Aer is needed only to build this simulator: the local mode takes the seed from the ``Executor`` options but ignores their ``noise_model``, so the noise must be set on the simulator itself. Passing a QPU backend instead would run the same program on hardware. Once the simulations are complete, we will calculate the postselection rate and expectation values to get a feel for how well the error detection worked before visualizing the data.\n"
msgstr "Primitif ``Executor`` daripada ``qiskit-ibm-runtime`` menjalankan keseluruhan program dalam satu job. Apabila diberi ``AerSimulator`` sebagai ganti QPU, ia berjalan secara setempat pada simulator itu, jadi kita memberikannya satu dengan hingar gate depolarisasi yang sama seperti yang kita gunakan untuk mencari semakan, dan menggunakan kaedah penstabil kerana semua litar ialah Clifford. Qiskit Aer hanya diperlukan untuk membina simulator ini: mod setempat mengambil seed daripada pilihan ``Executor`` tetapi mengabaikan ``noise_model`` mereka, jadi hingar mesti ditetapkan pada simulator itu sendiri. Menghantar backend QPU sebaliknya akan menjalankan program yang sama pada perkakasan. Setelah simulasi selesai, kita akan mengira kadar pemilihan-pasca dan nilai jangkaan untuk mendapat gambaran sejauh mana pengesanan ralat berfungsi sebelum menggambarkan data.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "9. Postselect checked circuit samples {#9-postselect-checked-circuit-samples}"
msgstr "9. Pilih-pasca sampel litar yang disemak {#9-postselect-checked-circuit-samples}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this package a check is implemented using entangling gates between one ancilla qubit and one target qubit. Each ancilla starts in $|0\\rangle$, so $Z_\\text{anc}$ stabilizes its input state. Forward propagating $Z_\\text{anc}$ from the beginning of the ancilla through the entire checked circuit yields $Z_\\text{anc}$ times a stabilizer of the prepared state, so the check passes if the ancilla bit is $0$. A sample is kept if every check passes.\n"
msgstr "Dalam pakej ini sesuatu semakan dilaksanakan menggunakan gate berkusut antara satu qubit ancilla dan satu qubit sasaran. Setiap ancilla bermula dalam $|0\\rangle$, jadi $Z_\\text{anc}$ menstabilkan keadaan inputnya. Merambat ke hadapan $Z_\\text{anc}$ dari permulaan ancilla melalui keseluruhan litar yang disemak menghasilkan $Z_\\text{anc}$ didarab dengan penstabil keadaan yang disediakan, jadi semakan lulus jika bit ancilla ialah $0$. Sesuatu sampel dikekalkan jika setiap semakan lulus.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The checked circuits measure the ancillas into the ``checks_c`` register, so a sample is kept if every bit of that register is ``0``. In general, the ``get_postselection_method`` method of the ``CheckedCircuit`` instances output from ``add_pauli_checks`` maps a shot's bitstring to the syndrome of every check at once; for checks found for the stabilizers of the prepared state, each syndrome is just its ancilla bit, so we read the register directly.\n"
msgstr "Litar yang disemak mengukur ancilla ke dalam daftar ``checks_c``, jadi sesuatu sampel dikekalkan jika setiap bit daftar itu ialah ``0``. Secara amnya, kaedah ``get_postselection_method`` bagi instans ``CheckedCircuit`` yang dikeluarkan daripada ``add_pauli_checks`` memetakan rentetan bit sesuatu shot kepada sindrom setiap semakan sekaligus; bagi semakan yang dicari untuk penstabil keadaan yang disediakan, setiap sindrom hanyalah bit ancilla-nya, jadi kita membaca daftar itu secara langsung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the chart, we see that adding more checks causes the postselection rate to go down. While the goal of error detection is to catch as many errors as possible, as postselection rate goes down more shots may be required to achieve some target accuracy. If the postselection rate drops too low, the number of shots needed to collect one logical sample may become prohibitive. In this example, the postselection rate seems to converge, implying that additional checks are contributing less additional detection capability. Although adding more Pauli checks generally provides greater error detection capability, it comes at a cost of increased circuit depth and an increase in sampling cost.\n"
msgstr "Dalam carta, kita melihat bahawa penambahan lebih banyak semakan menyebabkan kadar pemilihan-pasca menurun. Walaupun matlamat pengesanan ralat ialah menangkap sebanyak mungkin ralat, apabila kadar pemilihan-pasca menurun lebih banyak shot mungkin diperlukan untuk mencapai ketepatan sasaran tertentu. Jika kadar pemilihan-pasca jatuh terlalu rendah, bilangan shot yang diperlukan untuk mengumpul satu sampel logik mungkin menjadi terlalu tinggi. Dalam contoh ini, kadar pemilihan-pasca kelihatan menumpu, membayangkan bahawa semakan tambahan menyumbang keupayaan pengesanan tambahan yang kurang. Walaupun penambahan lebih banyak semakan Pauli secara amnya memberikan keupayaan pengesanan ralat yang lebih besar, ia datang dengan kos kedalaman litar yang meningkat dan kos pensampelan yang meningkat.\n"

